    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Generic Smart weapon</strong> (excellent quality): the type is built in, at no extra cost, and takes no slots.</p><p><strong>Smart:</strong> <strong>Link:</strong> the gun only works while connected to you by a Personal Link (Neuroport) or Subdermal Grip. <strong>+1</strong> to ranged Attacks with it, whatever it's loaded with. <strong>Improved Smart Ammunition</strong> works only in a Smart weapon, and adds two things: you ignore all penalties for darkness, smoke, fog and other visual obscurement; and when you miss by 5 or less you can try again at once, rolling <strong>14 + 1d10</strong> (LUCK still adds) instead of STAT + Skill + bonuses. The first shot's penalties carry over.</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Weapons</small></p>"
